Trunk router and switch:

Office_Switch#
Office_Switch#conf t
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
Office_Switch(config)#interface gig0/1
Office_Switch(config-if)#switchport mode trunk
Office_Switch(config-if)#switchport trunk allowed vlan 10,20,30
Office_Switch(config-if)#no shutdown
Office_Switch(config-if)#exit
Office_Switch(config)#end
Office_Switch#copy running-config startup-config


Router configuration:

Router>enable
Router#conf t
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
Router(config)#hostname Office_Router
Office_Router(config)#interface gig0/0
Office_Router(config-if)#no shutdown

Office_Router(config-if)#
%LINK-5-CHANGED: Interface GigabitEthernet0/0, changed state to up

%LINEPROTO-5-UPDOWN: Line protocol on Interface GigabitEthernet0/0, changed state to up

Office_Router(config-if)#exit

Subinterfaces on router:
Office_Router(config)#
Office_Router(config)#interface gig0/0.10
Office_Router(config-subif)#encapsulation dot1Q 10
Office_Router(config-subif)#ip address 192.168.10.1 255.255.255.0
Office_Router(config-subif)#exit

Office_Router(config)#
Office_Router(config)#interface gig0/0.20
